<title>SPAIN: FCAST-Repsol 9-mth net to fall 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>FCAST-Repsol 9-mth net to fall 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for Spanish energy group Repsol nine-month consolidated results, calculated on the basis of simple averages. Figures in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>			  JAN-SEP 96   JAN-SEP 95	 RANGE</p>
<p>Operating margin	147.79	 168.49     146.00 - 138.80</p>
<p>Net attibutable	  88.81	 92.15	 91.00 -  87.00</p>
<p>Contributors: ABN-Amro, Oddo, Ibersecurities, Ahorro Corporacion, Eurosafei.</p>
<p>Repsol is due to announce results next week.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
